#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:shopify.mk_operation_update_collection_to_shopify_view
msgid ""
"When sales channels are selected and the <strong>Publish/Unpublish</strong> button is enabled, the collections will be published only to the selected\n"
"                                channels, without removing them from any previously published channels."
msgstr ""
"Когда каналы продаж выбраны и кнопка <strong>Опубликовать/Снять с публикации</strong> включена, коллекции будут опубликованы только в выбранных\n"
